{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Downpour Dash is an exhilarating 3D platformer that puts your skills to the test with fast-paced levels. You can choose from an array of levels, each with their own respective difficulty and theme. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Downpour Dash's powerful level editor allows you to unleash your creativity, allowing you to design and share levels at the click of a button. With an variety of (almost) neverending content, master the most challenging levels and immerse yourself in a world where every jump matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced action platforming!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create and share your own levels using the level editor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High quality curated levels and user-generated levels for exhilarating challenges! </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2818640?t=1750442061","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750442061","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750442061","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750442061","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Downpour Dash is an exhilarating 3D platformer that puts your skills to the test with fast-paced levels. You can choose from an array of levels, each with their own respective difficulty and theme. </p><p class=\"